forge:['BORIN ASHBRAND','The forge is hot. Your weapon is not. Yet.','anvil','doomblade','ASCENSION ANVIL','axe','WEAPON RACK','dragon_scale_relic','TEMPERED STEEL'],
alchemy:['MAEVE OF THE VEIL','Do not drink the blue one. Actually, do not drink any of them.','flask','nectar','BREWING CAULDRON','herbs','HERB DRYING RACK','experience','DISTILLED ESSENCE'],
pets:['PIPER PAWKEEPER','They chose you. I would question their judgment.','companion','cat','RESTING PERCH','dragon','BONDING CIRCLE','goblin','TREAT BASKET'],
